cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research software, cite the specific archived version and its Zenodo version DOI."
title: "Temporal organization of intraday multifractality in XAUUSD: surrogates, temporal ablations, and conditional volatility models (reproducibility code)"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Baldiviezo Romero"
    given-names: "Ramiro Junior"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0002-0962-9676"
version: "1.0.1"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ramirobaldiviezo532/xauusd-intraday-multifractality"
abstract: >-
  Google Colab code and archived workbooks associated with an analysis of
  intraday XAUUSD multifractality using MF-DFA, surrogate data, temporal
  ablations, conditional-volatility benchmarks and secondary jump analyses.
  Research materials include an integrity manifest and documentation of
  input provenance, version records and random-state conventions.
keywords:
  - XAUUSD
  - econophysics
  - MF-DFA
  - multifractality
  - surrogate data
  - temporal ablations
  - conditional volatility
  - GARCH
